src/js/CONTRACTS.md:25:- `init()` on load for every `[data-map]` element. Options via data attributes: `data-zoom` (default 17), `data-focus="<slug>"` (open that pin's popup and center on it), `data-full="true"` (bigger, all layers on).
src/js/CONTRACTS.md:28:- Layers: `restaurants` (always on), `parking` (on by default), `landmarks` (off by default; on when `data-full`), `loop` (a dashed `L.polyline` connecting the four in order Rancho -> Harvest -> Kaia's -> Incontro -> Rancho, accent color from `getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue('--accent')`, plus small `.walk-label` divIcon markers at segment midpoints reading "1 min"). Toggle buttons `[data-layer]` with `aria-pressed`.
src/js/CONTRACTS.md:30:- Fit: on init, `fitBounds` around the four with padding 40 (or center on `data-focus`). Dispatch `window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('eat:map-ready'))` after markers are added. `scrollWheelZoom: false` until the map is clicked (so page scroll is not hijacked); `tap` friendly.

// CSS bundle
const cssOrder = ['fonts', 'tokens', 'base', 'components'];
const css = cssOrder.map((n) => fs.readFileSync(path.join(SRC, 'css', `${n}.css`), 'utf8')).join('\n');
writeFile('css/site.css', css);

